ortization" scale="6" id="f-561">14.1</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-4" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetBeforeAccumulatedAmortization" scale="6" id="f-562">13.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million as of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025, respectively, and related accumulated amortization of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-3" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAccumulatedAmortization" scale="6" id="f-563">6.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-4" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseRightOfUseAssetAccumulatedAmortization" scale="6" id="f-564">4.8</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million as of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025, respectively. Depreciation expense for the three months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-7" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="6" id="f-565">4.5</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-8" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="6" id="f-566">4.7</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively. Depreciation expense for the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-1" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="6" id="f-567">9.0</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-9" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:Depreciation" scale="6" id="f-568">9.5</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, respectively.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="margin-top:6pt;text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div id="i7b93f58188da46089de4a0367e123d3a_58"></div><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">7.  <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="us-gaap:IntangibleAssetsDisclosureTextBlock" id="f-569" continuedAt="f-569-1" escape="true">INTANGIBLE ASSETS</ix:nonNumeric></span></d